+| untouched complete `SPEC` | no filtering or trusted flags | 0 | `#Top` |
+
+Logs:
+[loop claim](/audit-output/evidence/03-kprove-loop-invariant.log),
+[entry with proved helper](/audit-output/evidence/03-kprove-entry.log), and
